[{"id":"inner_sea_races:race_trait:half_orc_pariah","label":"Pariah","value":{"Number":{"Const":-2}},"prose":[{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"While many cultures discriminate against half-orcs, in some, particularly dwarven communities, half-orcs are complete social pariahs. It goes without saying that such a culture does not provide outlets for a half-orc to practice with traditional orc weapons. The few half-orcs who survive to adulthood in such harsh social climates are deeply scarred by their abusive treatment and find it hard to express and understand normal emotions. Such half-orcs gain a +2 racial bonus on saving throws against emotion and fear effects and a -2 penalty on Bluff, Diplomacy, and Sense Motive checks."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"This racial trait replaces weapon familiarity."}],"applies":{"Not":{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"inner_sea_races:race_trait:half_orc_pariah"},"count":1}}},"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":{"Aspect":"SaveBonus"},"pieces":[{"Text":"+2 vs. emotion and fear effects"}],"pick_last":true,"suppress_when_all_zero":false}],"applies":{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"inner_sea_races:race_trait:half_orc_pariah"},"count":1}},{"Not":{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_players_guide:race_trait:half_orc_chain_fighter"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_players_guide:race_trait:half_orc_plagueborn"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_race_guide:race_trait:half_orc_chain_fighter"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_race_guide:race_trait:half_orc_city_raised"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"horror_adventures:race_trait:half_orc_projection"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"inner_sea_races:race_trait:half_orc_human_raised"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"inner_sea_races:race_trait:half_orc_overlooked_mastermind"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"inner_sea_r